     chips — bump the min-block-size so the chart's
     `aspect-ratio` machinery has room to lay out the SVG. */
  .chart-demo__preview {
    align-items: stretch;
    min-block-size: 240px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }
  .chart-demo__preview > * {
    flex: 1;
    min-inline-size: 0;
  }
</style>
